--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51fb4c6070f247e48b4377b5728b8182, type: 3}
  m_Name: H9_X2_1a
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - text: "It's just\u2026 I don't feel so good, my head has been hurting ever since
      I got here. And I feel very weak."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Oh, dearie me! That's not good.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c1e07724d9394b31aa9919cbfbf8b526, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: The two hybrids look at me with worried expressions.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 3
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Yes, let us take a rest before continuing on our path. At least we now
      know where we are, even if the circumstances still are a mystery to me. My
      hope to see my homeland ever again had almost perished.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: He's so happy to be here. I'm glad for him.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Sit down, I wouldn't want you passing out on me. Let me give you something
      that might help.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c1e07724d9394b31aa9919cbfbf8b526, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Samantha rummages through the bag hanging from her shoulder and takes out
      a small flask.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Here, drink this, it may help soothe your pain a bit.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c1e07724d9394b31aa9919cbfbf8b526, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 3
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 41de7d8911b06044eb1ffbfc63d6d72a, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6d7056c654b50c0419db7cd6b75ef9d6, type: 2}
